title: After a script is taken into an import (extension dropped) the list is done: the next enter is a new line, not the same entry again
folders: edit-paths
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-file: edit-paths/web/app.js :: (?-i)\nimport y from "\./lib/util\n\nZ\nconst data = "";\n

wait 3000
goto web/app.js
wait 1000
edit web/app.js 2 1
type import y from "./lib/u
wait 400
mark offered
wait 400
key enter
wait 400
mark taken
wait 400
key enter
key enter
type Z
wait 300
mark after-enters
wait 400
key save
wait 600
quit
